<title>NETHERLANDS: Nedlloyd Q1 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Nedlloyd Q1 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>First qtr 1997 (in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss from ordinary ops	45     vs   15</p>
<p>    Net loss after extraordinaries  45     vs   15</p>
<p>    Net loss per share (guilders)    1.98  vs    0.66</p>
<p>    Net turnover			 851     vs  804</p>
<p>NOTES - Analysts had expected Koninklijke Nedlloyd Groep NV to post a net result before extraordinary items between a nine million guilder profit and a 44 million guilder loss, with consensus at a loss of 17 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Operating profit		    13     vs   10</p>
<p>    Interest charges		    17     vs   28</p>
<p>    Tax					1     vs    3</p>
<p>Share in result of</p>
<p>P&amp;O Nedlloyd/</p>
<p>    Ocean shipping sector	    -38     vs   -3</p>
<p>    Non-consolid participations     -2     vs   -5</p>
<p>    Discontinued operations	  nil     vs   14</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		    nil     vs  nil</p>
<p>    Minority interests		 nil     vs  nil</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
